data
  title One choice cascades: where the source of truth lives
  desc Pick the truth's home first; migrations and DI fall out of it
  sequences
    - label Pick where the truth lives
      desc TypeORM: @Entity() TS classes. Prisma: schema.prisma generates the client.
    - label Migrations follow from that
      desc TypeORM: migration files from entities. Prisma: Migrate diffs schema to SQL.
    - label DI ergonomics diverge
      desc TypeORM: injected per-entity repositories. Prisma: one wrapped PrismaService.
